WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:01.568
O

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:06.373 line:78%
YOU.

00:00:01.668 --> 00:00:08.375 line:78%
WE HAVE TO QUICKLY GO AND CHECK

00:00:06.806 --> 00:00:10.210 line:78%
IN.

00:00:08.475 --> 00:00:10.643 line:78%
I KNOW YOU HAD TO RUSH INSIDE

00:00:10.310 --> 00:00:13.947 line:78%
MOMENTS AGO.

00:00:10.744 --> 00:00:17.350 line:78%
WHAT'S HAPPENING THERE?

00:00:15.181 --> 00:00:17.984 line:78%
&gt;&gt; GUNFIRE IS ERUPTING ACROSS

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:19.819 line:78%
KYIV AT THIS MOMENT.

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:22.956 line:78%
OFF IN THE DISTANCE, WE HEARD

00:00:19.919 --> 00:00:26.993 line:78%
GUNFIRE AND EXPLOSIONS AROUND

00:00:23.056 --> 00:00:27.293 line:78%
THE CENTRAL PART OF THIS CAPITAL

00:00:27.093 --> 00:00:29.162 line:78%
CITY.

00:00:27.394 --> 00:00:29.763 line:78%
A FEW MONTHS AGO, GUNFIRE

00:00:29.262 --> 00:00:30.930 line:78%
STARTED COMING FROM ALL

00:00:29.863 --> 00:00:32.932 line:78%
DIFFERENT DIRECTIONS, SO WE HAD

00:00:31.031 --> 00:00:34.067 line:78%
TO MOVE INSIDE QUICKLY.

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:36.770 line:78%
THERE WERE A NUMBER OF TRACER

00:00:34.167 --> 00:00:37.837 line:78%
ROUNDS YOU COULD SEE IN THE

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:38.938 line:78%
DISTANCE.

00:00:37.937 --> 00:00:40.874 line:78%
THIS IS WIDESPREAD IN THE CITY.

00:00:39.039 --> 00:00:45.345 line:78%
IT'S NOT JUST ONE LOCATION WHERE

00:00:40.974 --> 00:00:48.815 line:78%
THERE ARE UKRAINIAN TROOPS --

00:00:45.445 --> 00:00:49.516 line:78%
WARNED OF THIS SCENARIO,

00:00:48.915 --> 00:00:53.119 line:78%
BASICALLY SAYING THAT TONIGHT

00:00:49.616 --> 00:00:54.020 line:78%
WOULD BE WHAT DECIDES THE STATE

00:00:53.219 --> 00:00:55.221 line:78%
OF UKRAINE.

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:58.358 line:78%
CLEARLY, THE RUSSIANS ARE FACING

00:00:56.222 --> 00:01:01.361 line:78%
CLEAR RESISTANCE IN THE STREETS

00:01:00.193 --> 00:01:04.998 line:78%
OF KYIV, AND THE GUNFIRE

00:01:01.461 --> 00:01:05.331 line:78%
CONTINUES INSIDE THE CITY 

00:01:05.098 --> 00:01:06.466 line:78%
LIMITS.

00:01:05.432 --> 00:01:08.468 line:78%
OUTSIDE, THERE ARE REPORTS OF

00:01:06.566 --> 00:01:12.806 line:78%
MORE RUSSIAN TROOPS MAKING THEIR

00:01:08.568 --> 00:01:13.540 line:78%
WAY TO THE UKRAINIAN CAPITAL.

00:01:12.906 --> 00:01:17.811 line:78%
ATTACKING UKRAINE FROM MULTIPLE

00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:18.545 line:78%
DIRECTIONS AND THE CITY.

00:01:17.911 --> 00:01:20.313 line:78%
IT'S NOT JUST KYIV, WHERE THERE

00:01:18.645 --> 00:01:20.613 line:78%
IS RENEWED VIOLENCE TAKING

00:01:20.413 --> 00:01:22.382 line:78%
PLACE.

00:01:20.713 --> 00:01:23.016 line:78%
ALSO -- THE SECOND LARGEST

00:01:22.482 --> 00:01:27.787 line:78%
UKRAINIAN CITY TAKING FIRE

00:01:23.116 --> 00:01:28.488 line:78%
ACCORDING TO REPORTS.

00:01:27.887 --> 00:01:29.155 line:78%
WE ARE GOING TO LIMIT WHAT WE

00:01:28.588 --> 00:01:30.457 line:78%
SAY ABOUT THE UKRAINIAN AND

00:01:29.255 --> 00:01:34.627 line:78%
RUSSIAN SIDE TONIGHT IN TERMS OF

00:01:30.557 --> 00:01:36.863 line:78%
STATEMENTS ABOUT DIFFERENT

00:01:34.727 --> 00:01:37.530 line:78%
ACCUSATIONS MADE BY BOTH SIDES.

00:01:36.963 --> 00:01:39.199 line:78%
REPORTS OF PLANES BEING SHOT

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:41.000 line:78%
DOWN AND THOUGHT ALIKE.

00:01:39.299 --> 00:01:41.701 line:78%
WE WANT TO HOLD OFF ON THIS

00:01:41.101 --> 00:01:43.036 line:78%
INFORMATION, BECAUSE THERE'S A

00:01:41.801 --> 00:01:43.369 line:78%
LOT OF THINGS FLYING AROUND

00:01:43.136 --> 00:01:44.070 line:78%
TONIGHT.

00:01:43.470 --> 00:01:49.609 line:78%
WHAT WE CAN REPORT IS WHAT WE

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:50.276 line:78%
CAN SEE AND WHAT WE -- THERE ARE

00:01:49.709 --> 00:01:50.944 line:78%
RUSSIAN TROOPS INSIDE OF THE

00:01:50.376 --> 00:01:54.147 line:78%
UKRAINIAN CAPITAL OF KYIV AT

00:01:51.044 --> 00:01:56.382 line:78%
THIS MOMENT.

00:01:54.247 --> 00:01:57.851 line:78%
IT'S A WORST-CASE SCENARIO FOR

00:01:56.483 --> 00:02:02.755 line:78%
THE UKRAINIAN FORCES, BUT

00:01:57.951 --> 00:02:03.490 line:78%
RUSSIAN TROOPS ARE FACED WITH

00:02:02.856 --> 00:02:04.991 line:78%
DIFFICULTIES AHEAD, ACCORDING TO

00:02:03.590 --> 00:02:05.258 line:78%
THE PEOPLE THAT WE HAVE TALKED

00:02:05.091 --> 00:02:07.026 line:78%
TO.

00:02:06.493 --> 00:02:10.897 line:78%
EVERYONE WOULD TALK TO FOR

00:02:07.127 --> 00:02:12.932 line:78%
MEMBERS OF PARLIAMENT -- THEY

00:02:10.997 --> 00:02:13.967 line:78%
WILL NOT ALLOW THE RUSSIANS TO

00:02:13.733 --> 00:02:19.405 line:78%
OCCUPY.

00:02:14.067 --> 00:02:20.140 line:78%
&gt;&gt; THE PRESIDENT MADE

00:02:19.506 --> 00:02:22.976 line:78%
SPEAKER OF THE PRESIDENT MADE IT

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:25.011 line:78%
CLEAR IT MAY BE THE LAST TIME HE

00:02:23.076 --> 00:02:26.146 line:78%
SPEAKS TO HIS PEOPLE BECAUSE HE

00:02:25.111 --> 00:02:28.381 line:78%
BELIEVES HIS TARGET NUMBER ONE.

00:02:26.246 --> 00:02:28.781 line:78%
HE THOUGHT HIS FAMILY AS TARGET

00:02:28.481 --> 00:02:30.016 line:78%
NUMBER TWO.

00:02:28.882 --> 00:02:31.985 line:78%
WE ARE SHOWING THE VIDEO NOW.

00:02:30.116 --> 00:02:33.419 line:78%
HE IS ON THE MOVE.

00:02:32.085 --> 00:02:35.054 line:78%
WE DON'T KNOW WHERE HE IS.

00:02:33.520 --> 00:02:37.690 line:78%
OBVIOUSLY HE WANTS TO KEEP SAFE

00:02:35.488 --> 00:02:39.058 line:78%
BUT ALSO HE'S NOT LEAVING THE

00:02:38.091 --> 00:02:39.859 line:78%
COUNTRY.

00:02:39.159 --> 00:02:42.328 line:78%
SOME SO-CALLED LEADERS HAVE

00:02:39.959 --> 00:02:44.364 line:78%
ABANDONED LAYERS, AS WE SAW IN

00:02:42.428 --> 00:02:45.899 line:78%
AFGHANISTAN.

00:02:44.464 --> 00:02:48.501 line:78%
IN A SENSE OF HIS ABILITY TO

00:02:45.999 --> 00:02:53.673 line:78%
RALLY THE PEOPLE AT THIS HOUR?

00:02:50.003 --> 00:02:54.908 line:78%
&gt;&gt; HE IS TRYING THE HARDEST TO

00:02:53.773 --> 00:02:57.010 line:78%
RALLY HIS PEOPLE, SPEAKING

00:02:55.008 --> 00:02:58.611 line:78%
DIRECTLY TO THE POPULATION

00:02:57.110 --> 00:02:58.978 line:78%
SAYING THAT THEY MUST RESIST THE

00:02:58.711 --> 00:03:01.247 line:78%
RUSSIANS.

00:02:59.078 --> 00:03:03.249 line:78%
THE DIFFICULT PART HERE IS THAT

00:03:01.347 --> 00:03:06.920 line:78%
RUSSIA COMES TO THIS BATTLE WITH

00:03:03.349 --> 00:03:08.188 line:78%
AIRPOWER AND GROUND POWER THAT

00:03:07.020 --> 00:03:10.857 line:78%
THE UKRAINIANS EARLY ON WILL BE

00:03:08.421 --> 00:03:12.525 line:78%
ABLE TO PUSH BACK AND WE HAVE

00:03:10.990 --> 00:03:13.193 line:78%
SEEN THAT IN THE EARLY HOURS OF

00:03:12.625 --> 00:03:14.427 line:78%
THIS FIGHT.

00:03:13.293 --> 00:03:18.865 line:78%
BUT IT IS NOT SUSTAINABLE.

00:03:14.527 --> 00:03:19.365 line:78%
IT'S PART OF THE REASON THAT YOU

00:03:18.965 --> 00:03:20.099 line:78%
SAW UKRAINIAN

00:03:19.465 --> 00:03:22.402 line:78%
PRESIDENT ZELENSKYY APPEALING TO

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:23.770 line:78%
THE INTERNATIONAL COMMUNITY AND

00:03:22.502 --> 00:03:28.975 line:78%
PLEADING WITH HIM TO SEND

00:03:23.870 --> 00:03:29.642 line:78%
WEAPONS TO THIS COUNTRY.

00:03:29.075 --> 00:03:33.813 line:78%
YESTERDAY YOU HAD THE NATO

00:03:29.742 --> 00:03:36.216 line:78%
SECRETARY GENERAL JAN SULTAN SAG

00:03:33.913 --> 00:03:37.450 line:78%
THAT THERE WOULD BE AIR DEFENSE

00:03:36.316 --> 00:03:38.585 line:78%
SYSTEMS DELIVERED TO UKRAINE.

00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:40.019 line:78%
THE BIG QUESTION IS HOW.

00:03:38.685 --> 00:03:40.453 line:78%
THERE IS NO AIR TRAVEL IN THE

00:03:40.119 --> 00:03:44.524 line:78%
COUNTRY.

00:03:40.553 --> 00:03:45.425 line:78%
MARTIAL LAW IS DECLARED BECAUSE

00:03:44.624 --> 00:03:48.194 line:78%
FIGHTING IS ERUPTING IN THE

00:03:45.725 --> 00:03:49.996 line:78%
STREETS OF THE CAPITAL AND IT'S

00:03:48.294 --> 00:03:51.998 line:78%
TOO LATE, REALLY.

00:03:51.497 --> 00:03:52.365 line:78%
THIS BATTLE WILL LIKELY

00:03:52.098 --> 00:03:54.234 line:78%
CONTINUE.

00:03:52.465 --> 00:03:58.238 line:78%
YOU CAN HEAR IT.

00:03:56.269 --> 00:04:00.473 line:78%
&gt;&gt; THE FIRST THING YOU DO IS

00:03:59.138 --> 00:04:00.840 line:78%
TAKE THE AIRPORTS AND THEY

00:04:00.573 --> 00:04:00.840 line:78%
SECURE THE AIRPORT

